This workspace is the konashevich fork of QymCAD, not a clean upstream tree.

- Coding rules for the product remain in `CLAUDE.md` (via root `AGENTS.md`).
- Fork-only install, branch, and API/MCP intent notes are in `docs/fork/AGENTS.md`
  and `docs/fork/README.md`. Read those before changing fork layout or proposing an
  upstream PR.
- Do not edit root `AGENTS.md` for fork notes, and do not include `docs/fork/` or
  `.cursor/rules/fork-local.mdc` in a pull request to QymIs-Tech/QymCAD.
- Product work for upstream lives on `feat/qymcad-drive` (and later feature
  branches). Fork `main` may merge ops + features for daily work on this machine.
